    "detailed_description": "LEVELEERS is an escape room game without the rush (there\u2019s no time limit) with platformer elements and an isometric perspective that allows for unique puzzles that are not possible with a first person perspective.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear dense hand-crafted \u2018escape room\u2019-like puzzles.<br></li><li>Relaxing \u2018no rush\u2019 attitude.<br></li><li>Gorgeous atmospheric isometric world.<br></li><li>Classic platforming mechanics (jumping, crouching, running) add agility to the mix.<br></li><li>Three playable characters, two androids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities.<br></li><li>Discover the characters\u2019 heartbreaking story and help them find peace.<br></li><li>Play alone or co-op with your friends (locally or online).</li></ul><br>Outside-the-box thinking required ;-)",
    "about_the_game": "LEVELEERS is an escape room game without the rush (there\u2019s no time limit) with platformer elements and an isometric perspective that allows for unique puzzles that are not possible with a first person perspective.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear dense hand-crafted \u2018escape room\u2019-like puzzles.<br></li><li>Relaxing \u2018no rush\u2019 attitude.<br></li><li>Gorgeous atmospheric isometric world.<br></li><li>Classic platforming mechanics (jumping, crouching, running) add agility to the mix.<br></li><li>Three playable characters, two androids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities.<br></li><li>Discover the characters\u2019 heartbreaking story and help them find peace.<br></li><li>Play alone or co-op with your friends (locally or online).</li></ul><br>Outside-the-box thinking required ;-)",
    "short_description": "Help two androids and their cat, each with their own unique abilities, find their way out of the game itself. Think outside the box in this no-rush escape room puzzle platformer with dense hand-crafted puzzles. Immerse yourself in the atmospheric isometric world, alone or with your friends.",
